message: "If you use this programme release, please cite it together with the dataset and source-publication records required by the P4/P5 manuscripts. P6 R3 decoder-quality analysis is not executed."
title: "Human Motor Intelligence Research Stack: V2 Recovery R3 Interim Current-State Release"
type: software
