abstract: "Research code, retained artefacts, protocols, audits, manuscripts, and reproducibility records for the Human Motor Intelligence programme. P4 and P5 external validations are complete current-state evidence; P6 R2 is systems evidence and P6 R3 decoder-quality evaluation is blocked pending authentic traces."
